t{\\to }{XY} & =\\overset{\\to }{XO}+\\overset{\\to }{OY} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OX}+\\overset{\\to }{OY} \\\\  & =-a+b \\\\  & =b-a.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $XZ:ZY=5:2,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{XZ}=\\frac{5}{7}\\overset{\\to }{XY}=\\frac{5}{7}(b-a).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OZ} & =\\overset{\\to }{OX}+\\overset{\\to }{XZ} \\\\  & =a+\\frac{5}{7}(b-a) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{7}a+\\frac{5}{7}b.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256624 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "36986ba5-c1c7-5ea3-9029-fe6fbc5d146c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OC}=\\frac{1}{3}a-\\frac{2}{3}b" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254139} {:answer/id #uuid "3bd530a5-d4e3-580e-889c-5ada349d4218" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OC}=\\frac{5}{6}a+\\frac{1}{6}b" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254191} {:answer/id #uuid "4a0a0246-d60a-56af-9f8c-69a95f4900db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OC}=\\frac{1}{6}a+\\frac{5}{6}b" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254307} {:answer/id #uuid "8fa154b7-9e05-5e8f-bab5-281720591409" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OC}=\\frac{1}{3}a+\\frac{2}{3}b" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254929} {:answer/id #uuid "fa0d825b-907e-52e1-abed-caa127c11e30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OC}=\\frac{1}{6}a-\\frac{5}{6}b" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186255861}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4a0a0246-d60a-56af-9f8c-69a95f4900db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OC}=\\frac{1}{6}a+\\frac{5}{6}b" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186254307} :answer-field/id #uuid "7bbfddf2-46ce-5bb3-a95d-a3137cfc6517" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256150}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "61f6b767-fa3e-521f-814f-8371f7adf99c" :question/math-academy-id "q-12235" :question/problem "![](images/45/45110269c8a1ca9ad80cabc2f6c44592dca781afde7347d9d0a7e3363a76563a.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=a,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OB}=b$ and $C$ divides $\\overset{―}{AB}$ in the ratio $AC:CB=5:1.$ Find $\\overset{\\to }{OC}.$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OC}=\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=a,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{AC}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OAB,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\overset{\\to }{AO}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-a+b \\\\  & =b-a.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $AC:CB=5:1,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{AC}=\\frac{5}{6}\\overset{\\to }{AB}=\\frac{5}{6}(b-a).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OC} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AC} \\\\  & =a+\\frac{5}{6}(b-a) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}a+\\frac{5}{6}b.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186294966 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8cc1233-884e-55c1-bc0b-5c72b12ac47b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293600}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a8cc1233-884e-55c1-bc0b-5c72b12ac47b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293600} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b1935e4-b1db-59ac-bdd1-af6a29d2f762" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294076} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f22b1a6-2bb1-5ce8-b04f-37229ed9ed7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293395}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f22b1a6-2bb1-5ce8-b04f-37229ed9ed7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293395} :answer-field/id #uuid "3ea5bc20-1829-57bc-bf77-805686187035" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294146}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "02a8ac13-d9fd-5011-b248-20d1e825aecc" :question/math-academy-id "q-278263" :question/problem "![](images/c2/c26ec7e1fccc5ada4c43eef55faf9e4fa3e17ed896b1546f472edf744404da1a.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OD}=d,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OE}=e,$ and $F$ divides $\\overset{―}{DE}$ in the ratio $DF:FE=2:3.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OF}$ via the vectors $d$ and $e.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OF}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$d+$\n{{field-2}}\n$e$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OF}=\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OD}=d,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{DF}.$\n\nFirst, from $△ODE,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DE} & =\\overset{\\to }{DO}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-d+e \\\\  & =e-d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $DF:FE=2:3,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{DF}=\\frac{2}{5}\\overset{\\to }{DE}=\\frac{2}{5}(e-d).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OF} & =\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\  & =d+\\frac{2}{5}(e-d) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}d+\\frac{2}{5}e.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186294974 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a88c012-40c7-570c-9b0f-c30329a43052" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OP}=f+\\frac{8}{5}g" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293042} {:answer/id #uuid "32a48c96-17b1-56fa-b12d-996e52fb751e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{OP}=\\frac{5}{8}f+\\frac{1}{8}g" :db/id #ed