\frac{8}{13}(g-f).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OP} & =\\overset{\\to }{OF}+\\overset{\\to }{FP} \\\\  & =f+\\frac{8}{13}(g-f) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{13}f+\\frac{8}{13}g.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302111 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "798bd0e0-70de-587f-9840-15e882f63ca9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300562}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "798bd0e0-70de-587f-9840-15e882f63ca9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300562} :answer-field/id #uuid "0dacd43f-373d-54c4-96fa-27afeffa529d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301265} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2135a533-159f-5115-8bee-d5be3c469c8a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300120}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2135a533-159f-5115-8bee-d5be3c469c8a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300120} :answer-field/id #uuid "90eae733-f531-59d4-a171-4ead23e4e79d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301689}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "cf39b4a5-b11b-542b-bc1c-fed45785b019" :question/math-academy-id "q-322568" :question/problem "![](images/7e/7e92a09f8448f4d320f86656bc0774e6167b96156041c32eb7a64ba5e8820128.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OD}=d,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OE}=e,$ and $F$ divides $\\overset{―}{DE}$ in the ratio $DF:FE=3:4.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OF}$ via the vectors $d$ and $e.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OF}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$d+$\n{{field-2}}\n$e$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OF}=\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OD}=d,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{DF}.$\n\nFirst, from $△ODE,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{DE} & =\\overset{\\to }{DO}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{OE} \\\\  & =-d+e \\\\  & =e-d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $DF:FE=3:4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{DF}=\\frac{3}{7}\\overset{\\to }{DE}=\\frac{3}{7}(e-d).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OF} & =\\overset{\\to }{OD}+\\overset{\\to }{DF} \\\\  & =d+\\frac{3}{7}(e-d) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{7}d+\\frac{3}{7}e.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302112 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8d9de2aa-4041-5f76-b6be-fe41ae2704f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300678}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8d9de2aa-4041-5f76-b6be-fe41ae2704f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300678} :answer-field/id #uuid "894293cb-5bcb-5c58-bcf1-8fa19684d17e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301658} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "115586ce-ea68-5b73-b06d-7488ecd05e55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300032}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "115586ce-ea68-5b73-b06d-7488ecd05e55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{6}{13}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300032} :answer-field/id #uuid "cdd6dde1-aa3a-5f12-b998-fbca206e7fd2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301888}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ba11ec48-b1bc-5ad5-b2d2-084fb1f0daf5" :question/math-academy-id "q-322574" :question/problem "![](image