ned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302115 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e2a1c00-8cb8-59b8-999c-b1980e06520e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300587}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7e2a1c00-8cb8-59b8-999c-b1980e06520e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{8}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300587} :answer-field/id #uuid "268f3bd7-dd2a-5bdb-bad4-117ce7290310" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301348} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a7e90b75-2f39-50f4-ab84-711dcbfdae4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300808}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a7e90b75-2f39-50f4-ab84-711dcbfdae4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300808} :answer-field/id #uuid "30856aab-2bfb-535e-861a-9300f9697001" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301380}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "037303cc-6805-57a2-b1dc-ca793be48da0" :question/math-academy-id "q-322577" :question/problem "![](images/de/de33644bcad663e67dc19c687dc0ef959310a50ddb83203031e66b951700510b.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OU}=u,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OV}=v,$ and $W$ divides $\\overset{―}{UV}$ in the ratio $UW:WV=9:8.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OW}$ via the vectors $u$ and $v.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OW}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$u+$\n{{field-2}}\n$v$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OW}=\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{UW}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OU}=u,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{UW}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OUV,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{UV} & =\\overset{\\to }{UO}+\\overset{\\to }{OV} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{OV} \\\\  & =-u+v \\\\  & =v-u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $UW:WV=9:8,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{UW}=\\frac{9}{17}\\overset{\\to }{UV}=\\frac{9}{17}(v-u).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OW} & =\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{UW} \\\\  & =u+\\frac{9}{17}(v-u) \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{17}u+\\frac{9}{17}v.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302116 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b8ed698-dbb6-5343-a913-fe9fb4d1817c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300090}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1b8ed698-dbb6-5343-a913-fe9fb4d1817c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300090} :answer-field/id #uuid "77c690e5-687f-5145-90a7-53ff4b4d9a45" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301598} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d2bbeecb-5f96-5ae6-a1cc-831d9c3c1e71" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301010}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d2bbeecb-5f96-5ae6-a1cc-831d9c3c1e71" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{15}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301010} :answer-field/id #uuid "97cc111a-a639-515c-9c5c-fe8cdd60bdc6" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301714}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a5b0550e-551b-56de-8b66-92bcfdb0028f" :question/math-academy-id "q-322578" :question/problem "![](images/84/84ba52159416b3b420daa1ebd82dccac2411aee420201b9b9604937995d9553c.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OS}=s,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OT}=t,$ and $L$ divides $\\overset{―}{ST}$ in the ratio $SL:LT=11:4.$ Express $\\overset{\\to }{OL}$ via the vectors $s$ and $t.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OL}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$s+$\n{{field-2}}\n$t$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OL}=\\overset{\\to }{OS}+\\overset{\\to }{SL}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OS}=s,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{SL}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OST,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{ST} & =\\overset{\\to }{SO}+\\overset{\\to }{OT} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OS}+\\overset{\\to }{OT} \\\\  & =-s+t \\\\  & =t-s.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $SL:LT=11:4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{SL}=\\frac{11}{15}\\overset{\\to }{ST}=\\frac{11}{15}(t-s).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OL} & =\\overset{\\to }{OS}+\\overset{\\to }{SL} \\\\  & =s+\\frac{11}{15}(t-s) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{15}s+\\frac{11}{15}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302117 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "aa9e3a8b-c071-5d0e-81bf-ddc27065f654" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300818}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "aa9e3a8b-c071-5d0e-81bf-ddc27065f654" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300818} :answer-field/id #uuid "24470832-a4f9-57f7-99c2-0c4da16ae600" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301340} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e8a1594d-ec17-53b6-8cd8-9593fe66ca1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{10}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301114}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e8a1594d-ec17-53b6-8cd8-9593fe66ca1c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{10}{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186301114} :answer-field/id #uuid "3e6ba9e6-a7a1-5b0f-b138-160dc339aa31" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-fi